		{"id":"a6082fb2acba0e76","type":"text","text":"LLM","x":-1503,"y":2357,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"ccbd051b64a4df55","type":"text","text":"GPT\n","x":-1503,"y":1936,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{
			"id":"00c8d5a0e59c24b9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"模型结构:深度学习使用的是多层神经网络(通常包含多个隐藏层),而传统的机器学习方法如支持向量机、决策树、线性回归等,模型一般较“浅”,即它们通常由少量层组成。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-460,
			"y":2980,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"c56d2e1aad9d4bc9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"特征提取:传统机器学习依赖于手工设计的特征,需要专家根据领域知识来提取能够帮助模型学习的特征。而深度学习模型可以在训练过程中自动提取特征,尤其适用于图像、音频和自然语言处理等领域。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-460,
			"y":3060,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"bf45ab1c11861f8a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"计算资源:深度学习需要大量数据和计算资源,尤其GPU(图形处理单元)的支持,这一点在处理大规模数据时可以发挥显著优势。相比之下,传统机器学习方法对计算资源的要求较低,适用于数据规模较小的场景。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-460,
			"y":3140,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"bb85314710956088",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"性能:在许多任务上,深度学习可以超过传统机器学习方法的性能,尤其是当有大量数据可用于训练时。例如,在图像分类、语音识别和语言翻译等任务中,深度学习已经取得了显著成果。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-460,
			"y":3220,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"84cbad79791c91ff",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"黑箱性:深度学习模型通常被视为“黑箱”,因为理解这些模型的内部工作(特别是高层特征的提取和决策过程)非常困难。而传统机器学习方法,如决策树和线性回归,其内部机制通常更容易解释和理解。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-460,
			"y":3300,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"38753d8a40c18617",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"深度学习与机器学习的区别",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-780,
			"y":3140,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{"id":"0d1513d4cbd70d11","type":"text","text":"图象分类项目","x":760,"y":2940,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#00ff9d"},
		{"id":"e3538b4a32f933bc","type":"text","text":"目标检测项目","x":760,"y":3060,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#00ff9d"},
		{"id":"a7d9fdeeb95546b7","type":"text","text":"NLP项目","x":760,"y":3160,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#00ff9d"},
		{"id":"9fe6cc373bbbc31f","type":"text","text":"大模型应用","x":760,"y":3257,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#00ff9d"},
		{"id":"e7d10f4869dcdbed","type":"text","text":"项目实战","x":885,"y":2768,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#00ff9d"},
		{
			"id":"5104ff692a7de616",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# 如何评估深度学习模型的性能\n1)选择适当的评估指标:\n·分类问题:对于二分类问题,常用的评估指标包括准确率(Accuracy),精确率(Precision),召回率(Recall),F1-score等;对于多分类问题,还可以使用宏平均(Macro Average)和微平均(Micro Average)等。\n·回归问题:常用的评估指标包括均方误差(MSE),均方根误差(RMSE),平均绝对误差(MAE),决定系数(R²)等。\n\n2)划分数据集:\n\n· 训练集:用于训练模型。\n·验证集:用于调参和模型选择,避免过拟合。\n·测试集:用于最终评估模型性能,确保模型在未见过的数据上也有良好的表现。\n\n3)计算并报告指标:\n\n· 可以使用现成的库来计算这些指标,比如Scikit-learn中的classification_report和confusion_matrix函数。\n· 同时注意要报告并解释这些指标,比如是采用平均值、方差还是其他统计量来描述模型性能。\n\n4)混淆矩阵:\n\n· 混淆矩阵不仅可以帮助我们了解模型的分类能力,还能直观地反映出模型在哪些类别上存在误差。\n· 在多分类问题中,混淆矩阵的应用尤为重要,可以帮助找到常见的误分类情况,从而针对性地改进模型。\n\n5)交叉验证:\n\n· 常见的方法有k折交叉验证(k-Fold Cross Validation)和留一法交叉验证(Leave-One-Out CrossValidation) .\n·交叉验证不仅能给出性能指标的平均值,还能提供方差等信息,有助于理解模型的稳定性。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-20,
			"y":3250,
			"width":260,
			"height":190
		},
		{
			"id":"a25effdfa3475705",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"深度学习会学习哪些特征?\n纹理特征:\n轮廓特征:\n语义特征:\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-80,
			"y":3040,
			"width":260,
			"height":130
		},
		{
			"id":"2010069f380c2b06",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"随机\n\n`torch.rand(sz)`[0,1) 均匀\n`torch.randn(sz)`\n标准正态，初始化权重最常用\n\n`torch.randint(low, high, sz)`整数均匀，右开\n\n`torch.randperm(n)`\n0~n-1 随机排列",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2620,
			"y":270,
			"width":260,
			"height":280,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"232cc5c497797630",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"特殊矩阵\n`torch.eye(n)`\n单位矩阵\n`torch.diag(vec)`\n向量造对角阵",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2320,
			"y":450,
			"width":260,
			"height":160,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"b2d0b1c5534fedfa",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"序列区间\n`torch.arange(start, end, step)`\n等差数列，**右开**\n\n`torch.linspace(start, end, steps)`\n等分，**右闭**，默认 float",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2320,
			"y":210,
			"width":260,
			"height":220,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"cac0ef10c44e27ed",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## 三个必记坑\n\n1. **`arange` 右开，`linspace` 右闭**  \n    `arange(0, 11)` → 0~10；`linspace(0, 10, 11)` → 也是 0~10，但含 10。\n    \n2. **`torch.tensor` 一定复制，`as_tensor` / `from_numpy` 共享内存**  \n    改共享的张量会改到原数据，要注意。\n    \n3. **`empty` 不是全 0，是全垃圾**  \n    别直接读，先 `fill_` / 赋值再用。\n    ## 懒人四件套\n\n日常 90% 场景就这四个：\ntorch.tensor([...])      # 已有数据\ntorch.zeros(2, 3)        # 占位/初始化\ntorch.randn(2, 3)        # 随机权重\ntorch.arange(11)         # 序列",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2980,
			"y":50,
			"width":520,
			"height":460,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"4fd66d341ed836e8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"从数据创建\n\n`torch.tensor(data)`\n最常用，会复制数据\n\n`torch.as_tensor(data)\n尽量共享内存，不复制\n\n`torch.from_numpy(ndarray)`NumPy 转张量，共享内存",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2320,
			"y":-70,
			"width":260,
			"height":260,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"a42c1b65dd550ded",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"按形状填充\n`torch.zeros(sz)` /`torch.ones(sz)`\n全 0 / 全 1\n\n`torch.full(sz, val)`\n全填指定值\n\n`torch.empty(sz)`\n未初始化，快但值是垃圾",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2620,
			"y":-30,
			"width":260,
			"height":260,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"1606c4852bc0a579",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"标量/底层\n`torch.scalar_tensor(val)`0 维标量",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2620,
			"y":610,
			"width":260,
			"height":120,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"5f02b24f900dc54a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"张量类型",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1310,
			"y":289,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"9cd126131a4442b9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"多维数组,以类的形式封装起来\n类型:\n\t0维张量:标量, 一个单独的数\n\t1维张量: 数组[1,2,3]\n\t2维张量:二维数组,矩阵\n\t3维及以上,高阶张量",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1670,
			"y":259,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"6dac98c07f6accba",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"张量创建",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1670,
			"y":419,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"1c4c5f918599e699",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"形状变换(最常用)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1310,
			"y":539,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"4e6954a410eb39e0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"```python\nx = torch.arange(12)          # shape: [12]\n\nx.reshape(3, 4)               # [3,4]，能复制就复制，不能就共享\nx.view(3, 4)                  # [3,4]，只能用于连续内存，否则报错\nx.reshape(-1)                 # 展平，-1 自动推断\nx.flatten()                   # 展平成一维\n\ny = torch.randn(2, 3, 4)\ny.transpose(1, 2)             # 交换 dim1 和 dim2 → [2,4,3]\ny.permute(2, 0, 1)            # 任意重排维度 → [4,2,3]\n\nz = torch.randn(1, 3, 1)\nz.squeeze()                   # 去掉所有 size=1 的维度 → [3]\nz.squeeze(0)                  # 只去掉 dim0\ntorch.randn(3).unsqueeze(0)   # 插入一个维度 → [1,3]\n\ne = torch.randn(1, 3)\ne.expand(4, 3)                # 广播扩展，不复制内存（0 维才能扩）\n```\n**关键坑**：`view` 要求内存连续；`transpose` / `permute` 之后张量**不连续**，再 `view` 会报错，得先 `.contiguous()`。\n```python\ny = torch.randn(2, 3)\ny.transpose(0, 1).view(-1)             # ❌ 报错\ny.transpose(0, 1).contiguous().view(-1) # ✅\ny.transpose(0, 1).reshape(-1)          # ✅ reshape 会自动处理\n```",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1670,
			"y":530,
			"width":590,
			"height":720,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"38ea04e978db2e1f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"数学运算",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1320,
			"y":1450,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"785c2e1dd756cd92",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"归约(统计)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1320,
			"y":1530,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"767c71c52383d699",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"比较逻辑",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1320,
			"y":1610,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"673411f09dd3185c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"类型与设备转换",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1320,
			"y":1690,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"c9dcc77d9110e68b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"就地操作(in-place, 带下划线)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1320,
			"y":1770,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"6eed89221058b5e4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"自动求导相关",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1320,
			"y":1850,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"80c9e0c0a82874be",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"索引与切片",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1320,
			"y":1290,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"354c0e7265b64cd7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"拼接与分隔",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1320,
			"y":1370,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"4e2b803cfe8283b7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"```python\nx = torch.arange(12).reshape(3, 4)\nx[0]            # 第 0 行\nx[:, 1]         # 第 1 列\nx[1, 2]         # 第 1 行第 2 列，标量张量\nx[0:2, 1:3]     # 切片\nx[x > 5]        # 布尔索引，返回一维\nx[[0, 2]]       # 花式索引，取第 0、2 行\nx[..., 0]       # ... 表示省略前面所有维度\n```\n\n**坑**：切片是**视图**，改切片会影响原张量；花式索引和布尔索引返回**副本**。\n\n```python\ny = x[0:1]\ny[0, 0] = 999   # 会改到 x！\n```",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1680,
			"y":1320,
			"width":560,
			"height":140,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"b178ae5c1e8f1f0a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"```python\na = torch.randn(2, 3)\nb = torch.randn(2, 3)\ntorch.cat([a, b], dim=0)      # [4,3] 沿已有维度拼\ntorch.cat([a, b], dim=1)      # [2,6]\ntorch.stack([a, b], dim=0)    # [2,2,3] 新建一个维度\nc = torch.randn(6, 3)\ntorch.split(c, 2, dim=0)      # 按大小 2 切 → 3 个 [2,3]\ntorch.chunk(c, 3, dim=0)      # 按份数 3 切 → 3 个 [2,3]\n```\n`cat` 拼**已有维度**，`stack` **新增维度**，这是最容易混的一对。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1680,
			"y":1530,
			"width":560,
			"height":110,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"da79850f6187b117",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"```python\na = torch.tensor([1., 2., 3.])\nb = torch.tensor([4., 5., 6.])\na + b; a - b; a * b; a / b       # 逐元素\na ** 2; torch.pow(a, 2)          # 幂\ntorch.sqrt(a); torch.exp(a); torch.log(a)\ntorch.abs(a); torch.neg(a)\n# 矩阵乘\nm1 = torch.randn(2, 3)\nm2 = torch.randn(3, 4)\nm1 @ m2                          # 推荐写法\ntorch.matmul(m1, m2)\ntorch.mm(m1, m2)                 # 只能二维\n# 批量矩阵乘\nbatch1 = torch.randn(10, 2, 3)\nbatch2 = torch.randn(10, 3, 4)\ntorch.bmm(batch1, batch2)        # [10,2,4]\n```\n\n**广播规则**：从右往左对齐，维度相等或其中一个为 1 就能广播。\n\n```python\ntorch.randn(3, 4) + torch.randn(4)     # ✅ → [3,4]\ntorch.randn(3, 1) + torch.randn(1, 4)  # ✅ → [3,4]\ntorch.randn(3, 4) + torch.randn(3)     # ❌ 3 vs 4 对不上\n```",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1680,
			"y":1690,
			"width":560,
			"height":115,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"bef75fab9b648de0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"```python\nx = torch.randn(3, 4)\nx.sum()                 # 全部求和，标量\nx.sum(dim=0)            # 沿 dim0 求和 → [4]\nx.sum(dim=1, keepdim=True)  # → [3,1]，保留维度方便广播\nx.mean(); x.median()    # 注意：整型不能 mean，会报错\nx.max(); x.min()\nx.max(dim=1)            # 返回 (values, indices) 命名元组\nx.argmax(dim=1)         # 只返回索引\nx.std(); x.var()\nx.cumsum(dim=0)         # 累加\ntorch.sort(x, dim=1)    # 排序，返回 values 和 indices\n\n```\n**坑**：`x.max(dim=1)` 返回的是 `torch.return_types.max(values=..., indices=...)`，不是单纯张量。要值就 `.values`，要索引就 `.indices`。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1680,
			"y":1880,
			"width":560,
			"height":120,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"9add63c30ba8ad2a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"```python\na = torch.tensor([1, 2, 3])\nb = torch.tensor([3, 2, 1])\na > b            # tensor([False, False, True])\ntorch.eq(a, b)   # 相等\ntorch.all(a > 0) # 全部为真？\ntorch.any(a > 2) # 存在为真？\n(a == b).sum()   # 统计相等个数，常用\ntorch.where(a > 1, a, torch.zeros_like(a))  # 条件选择\n```",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1680,
			"y":2060,
			"width":560,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"73d30ae7419a54ec",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"```python\nx = torch.randn(2, 3)          # float32\nx.long()                       # int64\nx.int()                        # int32\nx.float()                      # float32\nx.double()                     # float64\nx.to(torch.float16)\nx.type(torch.int64)            # 老写法，to 更推荐\nx.cpu()\nx.cuda()                       # 有 GPU 才行\nx.to(\"cuda:0\")\nx.to(device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float16)  # 一步到位，推荐\n```\n\n整型张量不能直接 `mean()`、不能求导，记得先 `.float()`。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1680,
			"y":2180,
			"width":560,
			"height":100,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"2ece1ed7de4a4c97",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"```python\nx = torch.tensor([1., 2., 3.])\nx.add_(1)          # 就地加，x 被改\nx.mul_(2)\nx.zero_()          # 全置 0\nx.fill_(7)         # 全填 7\n```\n\n**坑**：in-place 会破坏自动求导图，叶子张量（`requires_grad=True`）尽量别 in-place，否则 backward 可能报 “a leaf Variable that requires grad is being used in an in-place operation”。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1680,
			"y":2320,
			"width":560,
			"height":140,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"fbc5a90c414f9d42",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"模型训练:\n3 + 2 + 5\n3:\n\t3个定义:\n\t\t第一个定义模型\n\t\t第二个定义损失函数\n\t\t第三个定义优化器\n2:\n\t2个遍历:\n\t\t外层遍历轮次,内层遍历批次\n5:\n\t\t前向传播\n\t\t损失计算\n\t\t梯度清零\n\t\t反向传播\n\t\t参数更新",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1000,
			"y":710,
			"width":260,
			"height":450,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"09ed1db772ac5c47",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"```python\nx = torch.randn(3, requires_grad=True)\ny = (x ** 2).sum()\ny.backward()\nprint(x.grad)          # dy/dx\nx.detach()             # 脱离计算图，共享内存\nwith torch.no_grad():  # 上下文内不记录梯度，推理时用\n    z = x * 2\nx.requires_grad_(False) # 就地关闭\n```\n\n推理/评估阶段一定要 `torch.no_grad()`，不然显存白涨。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1680,
			"y":2520,
			"width":560,
			"height":120,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"c152dc15907865a5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"深度学习是机器学习的一个分支,它使用多层神经网络,从原始数据中自动学习特征,并完成预测或决策",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-400,
			"y":250,
			"width":333,
			"height":100
		},
		{"id":"3f2ff0d6fb7a9cfc","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20261018204228.png","x":-460,"y":2680,"width":400,"height":259},
		{"id":"6f9c0d7c0e4d2b80","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20261018204403.png","x":-381,"y":2200,"width":400,"height":155},
		{
			"id":"c55f8437979829f3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"·第一层\n识别基础视觉元素 横线、竖线、颜色边缘\n· 中间层\n组合基础元素识别复杂结构 弧线、纹理块、局部形状\n·更深的层\n识别高层特征 三角形耳朵、胡须的细线条\n·最后一层\n综合所有特征,输出最终预测概率97% 是猫",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":120,
			"y":2160,
			"width":360,
			"height":260
		},
		{
			"id":"dc6c56eb09fb8f37",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"波澜壮阔的探索史\n\n1943-1958:第一次兴起\n麦卡洛克与皮茨提出神经元模型,1958年罗森布拉特提出感知机(Perceptron),能学习简单线性分类,迎来第一次春天。\n\n1969:第一次寒冬\n明斯基在《感知机》一书中指出其无法解决异或,XOR等非线性问题,击中要害,研究陷入停滞。\n\n1986:第二次兴起\n辛顿等人系统阐述了反向传播算法(Backpropagation),解决了多层网络如何高效训练的核心问题。\n\n1995:第二次寒冬\nSVM横空出世,神经网络受限于数据量少、算力不足(需要数周训练),再次进入漫长低谷。\n\n2006:第三次兴起(深度学习元年)\n辛顿提出深度信念网络和逐层预训练方法,2006年在论文中首次使用Deep Learning一词。\n\n2012:大爆炸(AlexNet)\nAlexNet 在ImageNet 大赛以15.3%错误率夺冠(比使用SVM的第二名低10%),全面引爆深度学习热潮。\n\n2012年深度学习爆发的三大条件:\n\n1.互联网大数据:李飞飞主导的1400万标注图像数据集ImageNet。\n2.GPU 硬件进步:llya敏锐应用GPU并行计算,将训练从几年缩短到几天。\n3.更好的训练技巧:ReLU激活、Dropout、更好的初始化策略。\n\n2017:大一统(Transformer)\nGoogle 发表《Attention Is All You Need》,提出Transformer架构。其超强泛化能力迅速统一了NLP、CV、语音等多模态领域,成为今天所有大模型的基础。\n\n2022:新纪元(生成式AI)\nOpenAl发布ChatGPT,让普通用户感受到Al对话的惊艳。上线两月月活破亿,深度学习真正走进\n每一个人的生活,生成式AI时代全面开启。\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-420,
			"y":-180,
			"width":380,
			"height":290
		},
		{
			"id":"4c3d4e27b38ff471",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"感知机, 是给定一组输入数据, 自动找到一条决策边界, 将不同类别的数据正确区分开来的机器.\n完整包含了神经网课所有核心要素的雏形:输入, 权重, 求和, 激活, 误差反馈, 参数更新",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":980,
			"y":-1540,
			"width":380,
			"height":160
		},
		{"id":"f289a3a551c4b01e","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20261018210120.png","x":580,"y":-2320,"width":400,"height":165},
		{"id":"d2e7c572b18d5437","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20261018210315.png","x":580,"y":-2097,"width":400,"height":126},
